      "Stafford, Stafford Springs, Staffordville, Stafford Hollow: one town, several names, and we answer to all of them. Castle Express has completed more than 40 moves in and around Stafford since 2023, from the mill-era houses on the hill streets around the Springs to the rural properties out by the lakes.",
